OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F331A1787855381
OL,3,CLeeds Ironman drops swimming leg over
OL,4,C'hazardous' water
OL,6,FThousands of athletes have learnt that
OL,7,Fthe Leeds Ironman triathlon will no
OL,8,Flonger include a swimming leg due to
OL,9,Funsafe water.
OL,11,FThe Ironman is know as one of the
OL,12,Fhardest endurance challenges in the
OL,13,Fworld. It involves a 2.4-mile (3.8km)
OL,14,Flake swim, a 112-mile bike ride
OL,15,F(180km) and a 26.2-mile (42.2km) run.
OL,17,FIt is the second time Leeds has hosted
OL,18,Fthe event which starts and ends at
OL,19,FRoundhay Park.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$R,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBYorks Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,332,360,250,120,000,100
PN,33102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F331A1787855381
OL,3,CLeeds Ironman drops swimming leg over
OL,4,C'hazardous' water
OL,6,FHowever, the event has cancelled the
OL,7,Fswimming leg of the challenge a day
OL,8,Fprior to the event on Sunday 16 August.
OL,10,FOrganisers said: "We are disappointed
OL,11,Fto announce that today's swim practice
OL,12,Fand the swim portion of Sunday's race
OL,13,Fwill not take place.
OL,15,F"The recent hot weather across the UK
OL,16,Fhas led to a bloom of blue-green
OL,17,Falgae, which can be hazardous to
OL,18,Fhumans.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$R,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBYorks Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,332,360,250,120,000,100
PN,33103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F331A1787855381
OL,3,CLeeds Ironman drops swimming leg over
OL,4,C'hazardous' water
OL,6,F"Test results from Waterloo Lake
OL,7,Fconfirmed the current blue-green algae
OL,8,Flevels are significantly above the
OL,9,Fthreshold for safely proceeding with
OL,10,Fthe swim.
OL,12,F"We recognise this is not the news our
OL,13,Fathletes want to hear ahead of race
OL,14,Fday, but rest assured Ironman remains
OL,15,Fcommitted to putting on an epic day of
OL,16,Fracing in Leeds."
OL,18,FThe event will still go ahead but will
OL,19,Fbe a bike-run event only.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$R,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBYorks Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,332,360,250,120,000,100
PN,33104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F331A1787855381
OL,3,CLeeds Ironman drops swimming leg over
OL,4,C'hazardous' water
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Leeds City Council
OL,7,Fadded: "We have been working closely
OL,8,Fwith Ironman on all aspects of the
OL,9,Fplanning for tomorrow's triathlon,
OL,10,Fincluding the testing of water quality
OL,11,Fin Waterloo Lake.
OL,13,F"These tests confirmed a growth of
OL,14,Fblue-green algae in the lake during
OL,15,Fthe recent spell of prolonged hot
OL,16,Fweather.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$R,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBYorks Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,332,360,250,120,000,100
PN,33105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F331A1787855381
OL,3,CLeeds Ironman drops swimming leg over
OL,4,C'hazardous' water
OL,6,F"A further check carried out yesterday
OL,7,Fshowed the algae levels were
OL,8,Fsignificantly above the safety
OL,9,Fthreshold advised by the UK Health
OL,10,FSecurity Agency.
OL,12,F"While we recognise that this is
OL,13,Fdisappointing news, the safety and
OL,14,Fwell-being of everyone participating
OL,15,Fin Ironman Leeds must, of course, be
OL,16,Fthe top priority for the organising
OL,17,Fteam.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$R,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBYorks Sport CReg RadioFRewind
FL,332,360,250,120,000,100
PN,33106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F331A1787855381
OL,3,CLeeds Ironman drops swimming leg over
OL,4,C'hazardous' water
OL,6,F"The cycling and running elements of
OL,7,Ftomorrow's event are going ahead as
OL,8,Fplanned, with the programme of
OL,9,Ftemporary road closures needed to
OL,10,Ffacilitate those two stages being
OL,11,Funchanged.
OL,13,F"We would remind the public that,
OL,14,Foutside of officially authorised
OL,15,Fevents, swimming in Waterloo Lake `
OL,16,Fand other lakes in Leeds's parks ` is
OL,17,Fprohibited under local byelaws."
OL,26,@uD@AOU
